source/NEWS-944-* "endpos" has been added to the filter language, giving the position
source/NEWS-945-  of the rightmost mapped base as measured by the CIGAR string.  For
source/NEWS-946-  unmapped reads it is the same as "pos". (PR #1307, thanks to John Marshall)
source/NEWS-947-
source/NEWS-948-* Interfaces have been added to interpret the new base modification tags
source/NEWS-949-  added to the SAMtags document in samtools/hts-specs#418.  (PR #1132)
source/NEWS-950-
source/NEWS-951-* New API functions hts_flush()/sam_flush()/bcf_flush() for flushing output
source/NEWS-952-  htsFile/samFile/vcfFile streams. (PR #1326, thanks to John Marshall)
source/NEWS-953-
source/NEWS:954:* The synced_bcf_reader now sorts lines with symbolic alleles by END tag as
source/NEWS-955-  well as POS.  (PR #1321)
source/NEWS-956-
source/NEWS-957-* Added synced_bcf_reader options BCF_SR_REGIONS_OVERLAP and
source/NEWS-958-  BCF_SR_TARGETS_OVERLAP for better control of records that start outside
source/NEWS-959-  the desired region but overlap it are handled.  Fixes samtools/bcftools#1420
source/NEWS-960-  and samtools/bcftools#1421 raised by John Marshall.  (PR #1327)
source/NEWS-961-
source/NEWS-962-* HTSlib will now accept long-cigar CG:B: tags made by htsjdk which don't
source/NEWS-963-  quite follow the specification properly (using signed values instead of
source/NEWS-964-  unsigned).  Thanks to Colin Diesh for reporting an example file. (PR #1317)
